  message: "Dogfooding re-confirmed (blinded severity 4/5): 76 distinct TOML dependencies (67 distinct names: rich/bcrypt/pro...) collapse to ONE Symbol.fingerprint (hgfp1:87e35a5c). Root reproduced: a single dependency line parsed as standalone TOML yields a tree-sitter ERROR tree whose leaf walk drops the name/version text. file (901/902 distinct) + package fingerprints are clean — the collapse is toml-dependency-specific. Same stamp_symbol_fingerprints fix. [dogfood]"  # ed6e
